{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://papex.app/contracts/cards/v1/merchant-config.schema.json",
  "title": "PapeX receipt cards: merchant CONFIG, format 1 (server-side authoring)",
  "description": "What a merchant's cards config looks like BEFORE resolution. Authored as JSON (RDH repo, later the dashboard), validated by this schema plus the publish lint (x-publishLint below, enforced by the publisher), stored as immutable versions, and resolved per request by the RDH cards Lambda into a resolved-cards.schema.json response. Never sent to clients. 1.7.0 scope: no emailCapture, insight or loyalty; the rule language is the minimal v1 (surface, device.id, sid, time window). Receipt-fact rules (receipt.total, items...) are v1.1.",
  "x-publishLint": [
    "L1 AUDIENCES: a card's surfaces may not mix 'app' with 'web' or 'clip' (preview may accompany either). App and clip/web audiences are separate card ids, typically pointing at the same offer template. [schema-enforced]",
    "L2 SAVE: an offer's actions (save) are allowed only when its surfaces are a subset of [app, preview]. [schema-enforced]",
    "L3 LICENCE: merchant.ageRestricted=true requires compliance.licenseLine (top level); the resolver stamps it as compliance.licenseLine onto every offer and every merchant-voice text/cta card that lacks its own. [schema-enforced for the merchant field; resolver-enforced per card]",
    "L4 1.7.0 TYPES: only text, offer, cta, savings, disclosure. No emailCapture in 1.7.0. [schema-enforced]",
    "L5 LINKS: every cta url is https and its host is exactly one of links.allowedHosts (the CTA host allowlist). [lint]",
    "L6 IDS: card ids are unique within the config; every card's `offer` names a key of `offers`; every perSid `pool` exists (inline `pools` or the cards-state store). perSid assignment is keyed by (offer template id, sid): CODE#<offerId>#<sid>, so an app card and a clip/web card built from the same offer give the same sid the same code. [lint]",
    "L7 TEST HOOKS: the `sid` fact and `debug` are allowed only when merchantId starts with 'test-'. [schema-enforced for debug; lint for sid]",
    "L8 LENGTHS: every string, after resolution (codes from template/pool at their maximum length), fits the resolved schema's limits; code values match the symbology's pattern and check digit. [lint]",
    "L9 COUNT: the resolver emits at most 6 cards per response (MAX_EMITTED_CARDS), after surface/schedule/when/caps filtering, in ascending priority (ties: config order). Clients accept up to 8. [resolver]",
    "L10 RULE SIZE: all/any/not nest at most 4 deep; at most 32 predicates per rule; `in` lists at most 64 entries. [lint]",
    "L11 EXPIRY: exactly one of validity.expiresOn / validity.validForDays. The resolver never emits an offer whose expiresAt has passed, and sets hideWhenExpired from the template (default true). [schema + resolver]",
    "L12 RULE FACTS (1.7.0): request.surface, device.id, sid (test merchants), now. Receipt-fact rules (receipt.total, items, ...) are v1.1: they need Kleene UNKNOWN handling for raster receipts and are not in this schema."
  ],
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "configFormat",
    "merchantId",
    "enabled",
    "merchant",
    "layout",
    "links",
    "cards"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "$comment": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "configFormat": {
      "const": 1
    },
    "merchantId": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9._-]{1,64}$",
      "description": "The RDH merchant_id (papex-rdh-merchants pk). Never sent to clients."
    },
    "receiptsFrom": {
      "description": "Optional ISO instant: this version applies to receipts uploaded at/after it (default: publish time). See cards-p1-plan §5.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "null"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/isoInstant"
        }
      ]
    },
    "enabled": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "false: every request gets status none (per-merchant kill switch)."
    },
    "notes": {
      "type": "string",
      "maxLength": 2000,
      "description": "Authoring comment. Ignored by the resolver."
    },
    "merchant": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "displayName",
        "timezone",
        "ageRestricted",
        "partner"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "displayName": {
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
            }
          ],
          "maxLength": 60
        },
        "timezone": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z_]+(/[A-Za-z0-9_+-]+){0,2}$|^UTC$",
          "description": "IANA zone for expiry and time windows. Default America/Los_Angeles."
        },
        "ageRestricted": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Cannabis/alcohol. Echoed to clients as merchant.ageRestricted; requires licenseLine (L3)."
        },
        "partner": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Echoed as merchant.partner. No 1.7.0 card depends on it."
        },
        "test": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Optional marker. A TEST merchant is one whose merchantId starts with 'test-' (L7); excluded from pilot metrics."
        }
      }
    },
    "compliance": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "licenseLine"
      ],
      "description": "Merchant-level compliance. Required when merchant.ageRestricted (L3). The resolver stamps licenseLine as compliance.licenseLine onto every offer and merchant-voice text/cta card that has no card-level compliance.",
      "properties": {
        "licenseLine": {
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
            }
          ],
          "maxLength": 120
        },
        "licenseNote": {
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 500,
          "description": "Authoring note (how/when verified). Never sent."
        },
        "licenseExpiresOn": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$",
          "description": "Lint warns 30 days before and blocks publishing after this date."
        }
      }
    },
    "layout": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "order"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "order": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/layoutOrder"
        },
        "rules": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 8,
          "description": "First rule whose `when` is TRUE sets the order; else `order`.",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "when",
              "order"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "when": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/rule"
              },
              "order": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/layoutOrder"
              },
              "$comment": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "links": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "allowedHosts"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "allowedHosts": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 10,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-z0-9]([a-z0-9-]{0,61}[a-z0-9])?(\\.[a-z0-9]([a-z0-9-]{0,61}[a-z0-9])?)+$"
          },
          "description": "The CTA host allowlist: every cta url's host must equal one of these (L5)."
        }
      }
    },
    "pools": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "perSid code pools, inline: poolId -> codes (issued in array order). May instead live in the cards-state store; either way L6 requires the pool to exist at publish.",
      "propertyNames": {
        "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{0,47}$"
      },
      "maxProperties": 16,
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "array",
        "minItems": 1,
        "maxItems": 5000,
        "uniqueItems": true,
        "items": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[\\x21-\\x7E]{1,32}$"
        }
      }
    },
    "offers": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Offer templates by id. Cards reference them; app and clip/web cards may share one template (Noah: same offer, segregated entries).",
      "propertyNames": {
        "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{0,47}$"
      },
      "maxProperties": 32,
      "additionalProperties": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/offerTemplate"
      }
    },
    "cards": {
      "type": "array",
      "maxItems": 96,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/configCard"
      }
    },
    "debug": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "TEST merchants only (L7): force a status for listed sids, to exercise client paths.",
      "properties": {
        "forceStatus": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 16,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "sids",
              "status"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "sids": {
                "type": "array",
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 16,
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{16}$"
                }
              },
              "status": {
                "enum": [
                  "degraded",
                  "pending"
                ]
              },
              "retryAfterMs": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 60000
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "allOf": [
    {
      "description": "debug is for TEST merchants only (L7).",
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "debug"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "merchantId": {
            "pattern": "^test-"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "An age-restricted merchant needs its licence line (L3).",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "merchant": {
            "properties": {
              "ageRestricted": {
                "const": true
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "compliance"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "definitions": {
    "plainText": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "allOf": [
        {
          "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001F\\u007F-\\u009F\\u2028\\u2029\\u202A-\\u202E\\u2066-\\u2069]*$"
        },
        {
          "pattern": "\\S"
        }
      ]
    },
    "layoutOrder": {
      "enum": [
        "receipt-first",
        "cards-first"
      ]
    },
    "cardId": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{0,47}$"
    },
    "surface": {
      "enum": [
        "web",
        "clip",
        "app",
        "preview"
      ]
    },
    "isoInstant": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}Z$"
    },
    "rule": {
      "description": "v1 minimal rule. A card shows only when its rule is TRUE; absent `when` always matches. 'now' is the server clock; the between bounds are UTC instants, inclusive start, exclusive end.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "all"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "all": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 1,
              "maxItems": 16,
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/rule"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "any"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "any": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 1,
              "maxItems": 16,
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/rule"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "not"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "not": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/rule"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "fact",
            "op",
            "value"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "fact": {
              "const": "request.surface"
            },
            "op": {
              "const": "in"
            },
            "value": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 1,
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/surface"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "fact",
            "op",
            "value"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "fact": {
              "const": "device.id"
            },
            "op": {
              "const": "in"
            },
            "value": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 1,
              "maxItems": 64,
              "items": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,64}$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "fact",
            "op",
            "value"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "fact": {
              "const": "sid"
            },
            "op": {
              "const": "in"
            },
            "value": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 1,
              "maxItems": 64,
              "items": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{16}$"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "fact",
            "op",
            "value"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "fact": {
              "const": "now"
            },
            "op": {
              "const": "between"
            },
            "value": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 2,
              "maxItems": 2,
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/isoInstant"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "codeSpec": {
      "description": "How the redemption code is chosen for THIS sid. static: one code for everyone (scope shared). perSid: the next unused code from pool `pool`, assigned once per (offer template id, sid) and stored as CODE#<offerId>#<sid>, stable across re-taps and across audiences; an exhausted pool drops the card (scope unique). template: a code derived from the sid; one token {sid4|sid6|sid8} = the last 4/6/8 hex chars; an UPPER-CASE token ({SID6}) gives upper-case hex (scope unique). The full sid is never allowed in a code: it is the receipt's capability.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "mode",
            "value"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "mode": {
              "const": "static"
            },
            "value": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[\\x21-\\x7E]{1,80}$"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "mode",
            "pool"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "mode": {
              "const": "perSid"
            },
            "pool": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{0,47}$"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "mode",
            "template"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "mode": {
              "const": "template"
            },
            "template": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9-]{0,40}\\{(sid4|sid6|sid8|SID4|SID6|SID8)\\}[A-Za-z0-9-]{0,40}$"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "offerTemplate": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "valueLabel",
        "title",
        "validity"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "kicker": {
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
            }
          ],
          "maxLength": 40
        },
        "valueLabel": {
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
            }
          ],
          "maxLength": 12
        },
        "valueSuffix": {
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
            }
          ],
          "maxLength": 12
        },
        "qualifier": {
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
            }
          ],
          "maxLength": 40
        },
        "title": {
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
            }
          ],
          "maxLength": 160
        },
        "terms": {
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
            }
          ],
          "maxLength": 500
        },
        "validity": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "countdown"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "expiresOn": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$",
              "description": "Last valid day, merchant-local. expiresAt = 23:59:59 that day in merchant.timezone, as UTC."
            },
            "validForDays": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 366,
              "description": "Last valid day = receipt purchase date + N (merchant-local)."
            },
            "countdown": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "hideWhenExpired": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "default": true
            }
          },
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "required": [
                "expiresOn"
              ],
              "not": {
                "required": [
                  "validForDays"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "required": [
                "validForDays"
              ],
              "not": {
                "required": [
                  "expiresOn"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "redemption": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": [
                "type",
                "code"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "type": {
                  "const": "code"
                },
                "code": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/codeSpec"
                },
                "caption": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
                    }
                  ],
                  "maxLength": 80
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": [
                "type",
                "symbology",
                "code"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "type": {
                  "const": "barcode"
                },
                "symbology": {
                  "enum": [
                    "code128",
                    "ean13",
                    "upca",
                    "qr"
                  ]
                },
                "code": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/codeSpec"
                },
                "text": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
                    }
                  ],
                  "maxLength": 80
                },
                "caption": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
                    }
                  ],
                  "maxLength": 80
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "compliance": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "licenseLine"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "licenseLine": {
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
            }
          ],
          "maxLength": 120
        }
      }
    },
    "configCard": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "surfaces",
        "type"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/cardId"
        },
        "surfaces": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 3,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/surface"
          },
          "not": {
            "allOf": [
              {
                "contains": {
                  "const": "app"
                }
              },
              {
                "contains": {
                  "enum": [
                    "web",
                    "clip"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "priority": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 999,
          "default": 100,
          "description": "Lower first. Ties keep config order."
        },
        "schedule": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "startsAt": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/isoInstant"
            },
            "endsAt": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/isoInstant"
            }
          }
        },
        "when": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/rule"
        },
        "notes": {
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 500
        },
        "type": {
          "enum": [
            "text",
            "offer",
            "cta",
            "savings",
            "disclosure"
          ]
        },
        "heading": {
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
            }
          ],
          "maxLength": 60
        },
        "$comment": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "const": "offer"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "offer"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "id": {},
              "surfaces": {},
              "priority": {},
              "schedule": {},
              "when": {},
              "notes": {},
              "type": {},
              "heading": {},
              "offer": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{0,47}$"
              },
              "actions": {
                "type": "array",
                "maxItems": 2,
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "required": [
                    "type",
                    "label"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "type": {
                      "const": "save"
                    },
                    "label": {
                      "allOf": [
                        {
                          "$ref": "#/definitions/plainText"
                        }
                      ],
                      "maxLength": 80
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "compliance": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/compliance"
              },
              "$comment": {}
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "const": "offer"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "actions"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "surfaces": {
                "items": {
                  "enum": [
                    "app",
                    "preview"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "const": "text"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "voice",
              "body"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "id": {},
              "surfaces": {},
              "priority": {},
              "schedule": {},
              "when": {},
              "notes": {},
              "type": {},
              "heading": {},
              "voice": {
                "enum": [
                  "merchant",
                  "papex"
                ]
              },
              "icon": {
                "enum": [
                  "tag",
                  "gift",
                  "star",
                  "mail",
                  "info",
                  "sparkle",
                  "clock",
                  "bag"
                ]
              },
              "title": {
